WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.720
But it changed nationwide.

2
00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:12.220
It was not only here, this system of teaching, which served as a wonderful way to teach.

3
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:17.140
In fact, right now I can visualize on the campus;

4
00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:20.920
I would love to have some of those students living in a home management house like that,

5
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:35.960
because the relationships that you developed and how you lived with people were so vibrant in a situation like that.

6
00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:45.340
I had girls who were all good friends, sorority sisters, who would come to the home management house and leave being almost enemies.

7
00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.100
So we had to work with the students, you know.

8
00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:54.280
And we would have a meeting every week about the problems we’d had this past week,

9
00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:57.940
and how’d we work them out and how could it have been done differently.

10
00:00:57.940 --> 00:01:00.200
Now that was a good experience.
